B.ahc=new A.ab(B.ahP,["Login","Logout","Signed in as","Continue with Google","Continue with Apple","Logout","Close","No authentication providers available.","A login is required so payments can be clearly assigned to your account. Your data is used only for this purpose and is not shared with third parties.","User ID","Copy ID","User ID copied.","Send error report?","A previous app failure was detected. You can send the report once or enable automatic delivery for future failures.","Send once","Always send","Later","Source","Occurred at","Reason","Error","Stack trace","Parent check","A parent or guardian needs to solve the task below before continuing with {action}.","Continue","Cancel","Answer","Enter the result","That answer was not correct. Please try again.","Solve this task","an external link","an in-app purchase","advertising content","a social feature","personal information sharing","this action","Confirm synchronization","Please review the planned changes before the sync starts.","Synchronize","Cancel","Confirm delta sync","Pending local changes and new cloud changes since the last sync anchor will be reconciled.","Start delta sync","Confirm full sync","Pending local changes stay intact. The full cloud dataset is fetched again and merged with local data.","Start full sync","Confirm cloud as source of truth","The local dataset will be replaced with the current cloud dataset.","Start cloud restore","Cloud restore required","Restore from cloud","This device is older than the current cloud GC generation. A normal delta or full sync is no longer safe.","Delete all cloud data?","All remote data, including sync metadata, will be deleted. The local database stays unchanged. Already synchronized local records are not uploaded again automatically afterwards.","Delete cloud data","Clear app data from the cloud?","App-managed cloud records are scrubbed into deletion tombstones while sync metadata stays intact. The local database remains unchanged. The scrubbed records remain in the cloud for up to {retentionDays} days so other devices can still synchronize the deletion before the remote tombstones are removed permanently.","Clear app data","Mode","Tables","New","Updated","Deleted","Cascade","New local","Edited local","Deleted local","Cascade local","Tables","Local pending changes","Table","Delta sync","Full sync","Cloud as source of truth","Without an extended adapter, new and edited local records are shown generically as edits.","Delta sync","Only local records with pending sync_status are uploaded. In addition, only cloud changes since the last successful sync anchor are loaded.","Full sync","Pending local changes are still uploaded. If the target cloud table is currently empty and the adapter supports it, already synced local records can also be seeded into the cloud once. In addition, the complete cloud dataset is loaded again and merged into the local database based on updated_at. The cloud is not automatically the source of truth.","Cloud as source of truth","Pending local changes are not uploaded. Instead, the current cloud dataset replaces the local table contents. Local records missing in the cloud are removed.","Local edits and deletions","Pending local edits or deletions are also not sent to the cloud in this mode. If the record still exists in the cloud, it will be restored locally.","Deletions","Deletions are synchronized as tombstones and applied on other devices as well. This also includes reported cascade deletes.","No local changes","There are currently no pending local uploads. The sync can still download remote changes.","Already synced local data can still change","This mode does not only compare pending local changes. Already synced local records can also be removed or replaced when the cloud holds a different dataset.","Close","Try again","Check status","Understood","Yes","No","On","Off","Unknown","No backup files are available yet.","The backup files could not be loaded.","Load more","Upload backup file","Choose a recognizable file name before uploading the complete backup.","File name","The file extension is preserved so the backup remains recognizable.","Enter a valid file name.","Upload backup","Uploading backup...","The backup file could not be uploaded.","Download backup file","The backup file is verified while it is downloaded.","Downloading backup...","The backup file could not be downloaded.","Cancelling the backup operation...","The last backup action failed.","Backup files are not supported on this platform.","The backup storage provider is currently unavailable.","Sign in before accessing backup files.","The selected account cannot access its backup files.","Access to backup files was denied.","The network connection was interrupted. Try again.","There is not enough remote storage for this backup file.","There is not enough free space on this device.","The backup file failed its integrity check.","The backup file no longer exists.","Another backup operation is already running.","The backup operation was cancelled.","The result is uncertain. Reload the backup list before trying again.","Debug","Additional framework details are visible only in debug builds.","Support request","We are happy to help. Please briefly and kindly describe how we can support you.","Email","Please review your message and then open the mail composer.","Message","Write your message here. Recipients, subject, and attachments are prepared by the host app.","Your message will be prepared as a support request.","Report","A report can include technical details or exported app data and helps us understand issues better.","Your message will be prepared as a report. Existing attachments will be included automatically.","Mail is not available here","The framework mail module currently supports only Android and iOS in this UI.","Mobile support only","The device and available delivery paths are currently being initialized.","Mail could not be prepared","The mail interface could not be initialized on this device.","Please set up a mail account","Email cannot be opened with the current device or screen settings.","Message","What is this about?","Attachment","The following attachment will be included automatically with the report.","Preparing email","Send email","Debug","Mail debug","Status and compose options live here while the production UI stays intentionally compact.","Status","Compose options","Attachments","Event log","No events yet.","Provider","Android mail flow","Native composer","Mail app detected","External composer","Attachments","Last result","Prefer native composer","If available, the in-app mail UI is preferred.","Allow external mail app as fallback","If disabled, only a native composer is allowed.","Body format","Fallback with attachments","Text","HTML","Off","Keep attachments intact","Allow dropping attachments","Init","Boot","Runtime","Availability","Page ready","Page blocked","Email could not be opened.","No suitable mail composer is currently available on this device.","At least one attachment could not be read.","in the native composer","in the mail app","in the system share sheet","Email was opened {route}.","Email was sent {route}.","Email was saved as draft {route}.","Email sending was cancelled.","No mail account is configured.","No suitable mail app is available or allowed.","The simulator or operating system does not allow the native composer.","Company policies, parental controls, or system restrictions block mail links.","External mail fallback is disabled for the current content on this screen.","For attachments, only a fallback path without attachment handoff is currently available here.","Mail could not be prepared.","Send email","initialize() succeeded, availability -> {availability}","checkAvailability() -> {availability}",u.O,"composeEmail() succeeded -> {status} via {composerKind}","{action} failed -> {error}","{setting} -> {value}","Delete account and data","Delete account and data","This cannot be undone.","What will be deleted","I understand that my account and all listed data will be deleted permanently.","Delete permanently","Deleting account","Please keep the app open.","Stop deletion","The account is gone. Finishing the cleanup.","Account deleted","Your account and its data were deleted.","Deletion stopped","Your account still exists. Nothing was deleted.","Deletion failed","Your account still exists. You can try again later.","Cleanup incomplete","Your account was deleted, but some cleanup steps failed. Retry to finish them.","Retry cleanup","The confirmed account does not match the signed-in account.","Cloud data","Confirm identity","Delete account","Sign out","Reset purchase link","Discard crash reports","Delete local data"],t.w)
B.cfB=new A.ab(B.ahP,["Login","Logout","Angemeldet als","Mit Google fortfahren","Mit Apple fortfahren","Abmelden","Schliessen","Keine Authentifizierungsanbieter verfuegbar.","Ein Login wird benoetigt, damit Zahlungen deinem Konto eindeutig zugeordnet werden koennen. Deine Daten werden ausschliesslich fuer diesen Zweck verwendet und nicht an Dritte weitergegeben.","Benutzer-ID","ID kopieren","Benutzer-ID kopiert.","Fehlerbericht senden?","Es wurde ein vorheriger App-Fehler erkannt. Du kannst den Bericht einmal senden oder das automatische Senden fuer kuenftige Fehler aktivieren.","Einmal senden","Immer senden","Spaeter","Quelle","Zeitpunkt","Grund","Fehler","Stacktrace","Elternbereich","Ein Elternteil oder Erziehungsberechtigter muss die Aufgabe unten loesen, bevor mit {action} fortgefahren wird.","Fortfahren","Abbrechen","Antwort","Ergebnis eingeben","Die Antwort war nicht korrekt. Bitte noch einmal versuchen.","Bitte loese diese Aufgabe","einem externen Link","einem In-App-Kauf","Werbeinhalt","einer Social-Funktion","der Weitergabe persoenlicher Informationen","dieser Aktion","Synchronisierung bestaetigen","Bitte pruefe die geplanten Aenderungen vor dem Start der Synchronisierung.","Synchronisieren","Abbrechen","Delta-Sync bestaetigen","Lokale pending Aenderungen und neue Cloud-Aenderungen seit dem letzten Sync-Stand werden abgeglichen.","Delta-Sync starten","Vollsync bestaetigen","Lokale pending Aenderungen bleiben erhalten. Bei leerem Ziel-Cloud-Bestand kann der Vollsync ausserdem den kompletten lokalen Bestand hochladen. Danach wird der komplette Cloud-Bestand neu geladen und mit lokal zusammengefuehrt.","Vollsync starten","Cloud als Master bestaetigen","Der lokale Datenbestand wird durch den aktuellen Cloud-Bestand ersetzt.","Cloud als Master starten","Cloud als Master erforderlich","Cloud als Master","Dieses Geraet ist aelter als die aktuelle Cloud-GC-Generation. Ein normaler Delta- oder Vollsync ist nicht mehr sicher.","Cloud wirklich leeren?","Alle Remote-Daten inklusive Sync-Metadaten werden geloescht. Die lokale Datenbank bleibt unveraendert. Bereits synchronisierte lokale Datensaetze werden danach nicht automatisch erneut hochgeladen.","Cloud leeren","Anwendungsdaten in der Cloud leeren?","Die anwendungsbezogenen Cloud-Datensaetze werden zu bereinigten Loesch-Tombstones umgeschrieben, waehrend die Sync-Metadaten erhalten bleiben. Die lokale Datenbank bleibt unveraendert. Diese bereinigten Datensaetze bleiben noch bis zu {retentionDays} Tage in der Cloud, damit andere Geraete die Loeschung noch synchronisieren koennen, bevor die Remote-Tombstones endgueltig entfernt werden.","Anwendungsdaten leeren","Modus","Tabellen","Neu","Bearbeitet","Loeschen","Cascade","Neu lokal","Bearb. lokal","Loesch. lokal","Cascade lokal","Tabellen","Lokale offene Aenderungen","Tabelle","Delta-Sync","Vollsync","Cloud als Master","Neue und bearbeitete lokale Datensaetze werden ohne erweiterten Adapter generisch als Bearbeitungen angezeigt.","Delta-Sync","Nur lokale Datensaetze mit ausstehendem sync_status werden hochgeladen. Zusaetzlich werden nur Cloud-Aenderungen seit dem letzten erfolgreichen Sync-Stand geladen.","Vollsync","Lokale ausstehende Aenderungen werden weiterhin hochgeladen. Zusaetzlich wird der komplette Cloud-Bestand neu geladen und per updated_at mit der lokalen Datenbank zusammengefuehrt. Die Cloud ist dabei nicht automatisch Master.","Cloud als Master","Lokale ausstehende Aenderungen werden nicht hochgeladen. Stattdessen ersetzt der aktuelle Cloud-Bestand den lokalen Tabelleninhalt. Lokale Datensaetze, die in der Cloud fehlen, werden entfernt.","Lokale Bearbeitungen und Loeschungen","Auch lokal vorgemerkte Bearbeitungen oder Loeschungen werden in diesem Modus nicht zur Cloud geschickt. Existiert der Datensatz noch in der Cloud, wird er lokal wiederhergestellt.","Loeschungen","Loeschungen werden als Tombstones synchronisiert und auf anderen Geraeten ebenfalls angewendet. Dazu zaehlen auch gemeldete Cascade-Deletes.","Keine lokalen Aenderungen","Aktuell sind keine lokalen ausstehenden Uploads vorhanden. Der Sync kann trotzdem Remote-Aenderungen herunterladen.","Auch synchronisierte lokale Daten koennen sich aendern","Dieser Modus vergleicht nicht nur offene lokale Aenderungen. Auch bereits synchronisierte lokale Datensaetze koennen entfernt oder ersetzt werden, wenn die Cloud einen anderen Bestand hat.","Schliessen","Erneut versuchen","Status pruefen","Verstanden","Ja","Nein","An","Aus","Unbekannt","Es sind noch keine Backup-Dateien vorhanden.","Die Backup-Dateien konnten nicht geladen werden.","Mehr laden","Backup-Datei hochladen","Waehle vor dem Upload des vollstaendigen Backups einen gut erkennbaren Dateinamen.","Dateiname","Die Dateiendung bleibt erhalten, damit das Backup erkennbar bleibt.","Gib einen gueltigen Dateinamen ein.","Backup hochladen","Backup wird hochgeladen...","Die Backup-Datei konnte nicht hochgeladen werden.","Backup-Datei herunterladen","Die Backup-Datei wird beim Herunterladen geprueft.","Backup wird heruntergeladen...","Die Backup-Datei konnte nicht heruntergeladen werden.","Backup-Vorgang wird abgebrochen...","Die letzte Backup-Aktion ist fehlgeschlagen.","Backup-Dateien werden auf dieser Plattform nicht unterstuetzt.","Der Backup-Speicher ist derzeit nicht verfuegbar.","Melde dich an, bevor du auf Backup-Dateien zugreifst.","Das ausgewaehlte Konto kann nicht auf seine Backup-Dateien zugreifen.","Der Zugriff auf die Backup-Dateien wurde verweigert.","Die Netzwerkverbindung wurde unterbrochen. Versuche es erneut.","Der entfernte Speicher reicht fuer diese Backup-Datei nicht aus.","Auf diesem Geraet ist nicht genuegend freier Speicher vorhanden.","Die Integritaetspruefung der Backup-Datei ist fehlgeschlagen.","Die Backup-Datei ist nicht mehr vorhanden.","Ein anderer Backup-Vorgang wird bereits ausgefuehrt.","Der Backup-Vorgang wurde abgebrochen.","Das Ergebnis ist unklar. Lade die Backup-Liste vor einem neuen Versuch neu.","Debug","Zusaetzliche Framework-Details sind nur im Debug-Build sichtbar.","Supportanfrage","Wir helfen gerne weiter. Beschreiben Sie bitte kurz und freundlich, wobei wir Sie unterstuetzen koennen.","E-Mail","Bitte pruefen Sie Ihre Nachricht und oeffnen Sie anschliessend den Mail-Composer.","Nachricht","Schreiben Sie hier Ihre Nachricht. Empfaenger, Betreff und Anhaenge werden von der Host-App vorbereitet.","Ihre Nachricht wird als Supportanfrage vorbereitet.","Report","Ein Report kann technische Angaben oder exportierte App-Daten enthalten und hilft dabei, Probleme besser nachzuvollziehen.","Ihre Nachricht wird als Report vorbereitet. Vorhandene Anhaenge werden automatisch mitgegeben.","Mail ist hier nicht verfuegbar","Das Framework-Mail-Modul unterstuetzt in dieser UI aktuell nur Android und iOS.","Nur Mobile-Support","Das Geraet und die verfuegbaren Versandwege werden gerade initialisiert.","Mail konnte nicht vorbereitet werden","Die Mail-Schnittstelle konnte auf diesem Geraet nicht initialisiert werden.","Bitte richte einen Mail-Account ein","E-Mail kann mit den aktuellen Geraete- oder Seiten-Einstellungen nicht geoeffnet werden.","Nachricht","Worum geht es?","Anhang","Der folgende Anhang wird automatisch zusammen mit dem Report uebergeben.","Mail wird vorbereitet","Mail senden","Debug","Mail Debug","Hier liegen Status und Compose-Optionen, waehrend die produktive UI bewusst kompakt bleibt.","Status","Compose-Optionen","Anhaenge","Event-Log","Noch keine Events.","Provider","Android Mail-Flow","Native Composer","Mail-App erkannt","Externer Composer","Anhaenge","Letztes Ergebnis","Nativen Composer bevorzugen","Wenn vorhanden, wird die In-App-Mail-UI bevorzugt.","Externe Mail-App als Fallback erlauben","Wenn deaktiviert, bleibt nur ein nativer Composer erlaubt.","Body-Format","Fallback mit Anhaengen","Text","HTML","Aus","Anhaenge beibehalten","Mit Wegfall von Anhaengen","Init","Boot","Runtime","Availability","Seite: sendefaehig","Seite: blockiert","Mail konnte nicht geoeffnet werden.","Auf diesem Geraet ist aktuell kein passender Mail-Composer verfuegbar.","Mindestens ein Anhang konnte nicht gelesen werden.","im nativen Composer","in der Mail-App","im System-Share-Sheet","Mail wurde {route} geoeffnet.","Mail wurde {route} gesendet.","Mail wurde {route} als Entwurf gesichert.","Mail-Versand wurde abgebrochen.","Es ist kein Mail-Account eingerichtet.","Es ist keine passende Mail-App verfuegbar oder freigegeben.","Der Simulator oder das Betriebssystem erlaubt den nativen Composer nicht.","Firmenrichtlinien, Jugendschutz oder Systemrestriktionen blockieren Mail-Links.","Auf dieser Seite ist der externe Mail-Fallback fuer den aktuellen Inhalt deaktiviert.","Mit Anhang ist hier aktuell nur ein Fallback-Weg verfuegbar, der Anhaenge nicht uebernehmen kann.","Mail konnte nicht vorbereitet werden.","E-Mail senden","initialize() erfolgreich, availability -> {availability}","checkAvailability() -> {availability}",u.O,"composeEmail() erfolgreich -> {status} via {composerKind}","{action} fehlgeschlagen -> {error}","{setting} -> {value}","Konto und Daten loeschen","Konto und Daten loeschen","Das laesst sich nicht rueckgaengig machen.","Das wird geloescht","Ich verstehe, dass mein Konto und alle aufgefuehrten Daten endgueltig geloescht werden.","Endgueltig loeschen","Konto wird geloescht","Bitte die App geoeffnet lassen.","Loeschung abbrechen","Das Konto ist geloescht. Die Bereinigung wird abgeschlossen.","Konto geloescht","Dein Konto und seine Daten wurden geloescht.","Loeschung abgebrochen","Dein Konto besteht weiterhin. Es wurde nichts geloescht.","Loeschung fehlgeschlagen","Dein Konto besteht weiterhin. Du kannst es spaeter erneut versuchen.","Bereinigung unvollstaendig","Dein Konto wurde geloescht, aber einige Bereinigungsschritte sind fehlgeschlagen. Erneut versuchen, um sie abzuschliessen.","Bereinigung wiederholen","Das bestaetigte Konto passt nicht zum angemeldeten Konto.","Cloud-Daten","Identitaet bestaetigen","Konto loeschen","Abmelden","Kaufzuordnung zuruecksetzen","Absturzberichte verwerfen","Lokale Daten loeschen"],t.w)
